			<h1> <strong> Ontario’s Trade Team </strong> </h1>

			<p class="fw-normal mb-6"> Our Senior International Market Consultants are based in Ontario and travel regularly to the regions they serve, connecting Ontario suppliers with international distributors and buyers.
				<br> <br> With deep expertise in Ontario’s diverse industries and established global networks, they provide valuable insights into key players and the province’s business-friendly environment.
				They offer personalized support to help Ontario businesses export leading-edge, cost-competitive products, services and technologies.
				<br> <br> Contact your sector/region specialist today to find out how they can help grow your business here and abroad.
				<br> <br>
			</p>
